[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3448421210","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112037#issuecomment-3448421210","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112037","id":3448421210,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Nirta","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-26T11:02:24Z","updated_at":"2025-10-26T11:02:24Z","body":"This is not the same filter, this isn't for `CanvasItem`s, but for `Viewport`, see:\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/86263\n\nIt's only used here:\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/0fdb93cde6ccb5176f96b0ddbba08d83e6c6aef2/main/main.cpp#L4420-L4425\n\nSo this would require adding these to `Viewport` to be able to add them to the project settings","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3448421210/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3448450608","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112037#issuecomment-3448450608","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112037","id":3448450608,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Niy4w","user":{"login":"RebelliousX","id":1888186,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4ODgxODY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1888186?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RebelliousX","html_url":"https://github.com/RebelliousX","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RebelliousX/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RebelliousX/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RebelliousX/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RebelliousX/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RebelliousX/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RebelliousX/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RebelliousX/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RebelliousX/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RebelliousX/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-26T11:49:06Z","updated_at":"2025-10-26T11:49:06Z","body":"Yes, that is what I am asking, I believe it is doable.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3448450608/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3448451586","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112037#issuecomment-3448451586","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112037","id":3448451586,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7NizIC","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-26T11:50:50Z","updated_at":"2025-10-26T11:50:50Z","body":"This is easily worked around by setting it on the root node of the scene, you don't have to manually set it on every node, see also that other report for a likely reason this was done originally ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3448451586/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3448451628","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112037#issuecomment-3448451628","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112037","id":3448451628,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7NizIs","user":{"login":"kleonc","id":9283098,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyODMwOTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9283098?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc","html_url":"https://github.com/kleonc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-26T11:50:56Z","updated_at":"2025-10-26T11:50:56Z","body":"> Without adding these two filtering options, I have to manually adjust these nested texture nodes to have anisotropic filtering. Which is not ideal.\n\n[`RenderingServer.viewport_set_default_canvas_item_texture_filter`](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/4.5/classes/class_renderingserver.html#class-renderingserver-method-viewport-set-default-canvas-item-texture-filter) doesn't have such limitation, so as a workaround you can do something like:\n```gdscript\nvar viewport: Viewport = get_tree().root\nRenderingServer.viewport_set_default_canvas_item_texture_filter(viewport.get_viewport_rid(), RenderingServer.CANVAS_ITEM_TEXTURE_FILTER_LINEAR_WITH_MIPMAPS_ANISOTROPIC)\n```\n\n> So this would require adding these to Viewport to be able to add them to the project settings\n\nAnd adding them to Viewport should be straightforward given RenderingServer already allows them.\n\nThe question remains whether we want to provide such options in the Viewport (and Project Settings for the root Viewport).\nI think they should be available, even if they're considered as a potential footgun for the users, performance-wise. It could always be discouraged to choose these options in the docs/tooltip.\nBut not adding them should be fine too given RenderingServer already allows setting them manually (in case someone really wants to).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3448451628/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3448459333","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112037#issuecomment-3448459333","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112037","id":3448459333,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Ni1BF","user":{"login":"RebelliousX","id":1888186,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4ODgxODY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1888186?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RebelliousX","html_url":"https://github.com/RebelliousX","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RebelliousX/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RebelliousX/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RebelliousX/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RebelliousX/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RebelliousX/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RebelliousX/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RebelliousX/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RebelliousX/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RebelliousX/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-26T12:02:57Z","updated_at":"2025-10-26T12:11:49Z","body":"Why are we talking about workarounds instead of talking about adding the 2 options?\n\nThere is no discernable performance difference between turning Anisotropic filtering on and off. It probably made a difference back in OpenGL 2 days. Today's hardware is capable of doing that and nobody notices any drops in performance.\n\nI still get over 600FPS+ (anisotropic 16x on or off) in my game with hundreds of different textures the smallest is 512x512 and biggest is 2048x2048. \n\nSo, if it is possible to add it using `RendereingServer` in code, then it should be possible to add it in the Project editor's settings. I don't understand why we tell users \"do this as workaround\" instead of a proper fix? Most users don't even touch `RenderingServer` class at all.\n\nAnd the quality difference as shown in the images comparison above speaks volumes. I believe adding these two options is really worth it.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3448459333/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3448466022","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112037#issuecomment-3448466022","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112037","id":3448466022,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Ni2pm","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-26T12:13:00Z","updated_at":"2025-10-26T12:13:00Z","body":"Because any new feature needs to be weighed against all the options, if a feature is costly or not relevant/used for most users and there is a simple workaround for power users that's highly relevant to consider, that's how the process of deciding on features works. Talking about alternatives means we *are* talking about adding those two options","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3448466022/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":1,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3448467970","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112037#issuecomment-3448467970","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112037","id":3448467970,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Ni3IC","user":{"login":"RebelliousX","id":1888186,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4ODgxODY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1888186?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RebelliousX","html_url":"https://github.com/RebelliousX","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RebelliousX/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RebelliousX/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RebelliousX/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RebelliousX/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RebelliousX/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RebelliousX/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RebelliousX/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RebelliousX/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RebelliousX/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-26T12:16:08Z","updated_at":"2025-10-26T12:16:08Z","body":"and can you give me the downside of adding the options instead of exposing the settings to the normal layman user?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3448467970/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3448718919","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112037#issuecomment-3448718919","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112037","id":3448718919,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Nj0ZH","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-26T17:33:23Z","updated_at":"2025-10-26T17:33:23Z","body":"> and can you give me the downside of adding the options instead of exposing the settings to the normal layman user?\n\nThey look the same as the non anisotropic versions for 2D and they hurt performance, especially for mobile devices. \n\nThe options exposed in settings should be safe options that users can set without much thought. We really should not be exposing settings that make no difference other than harming performance. You are still able to set the values directly through the rendering server if you really want them, but this isn't something that should be exposed in the project settings","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3448718919/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":3,"-1":1,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":2,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3448746806","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112037#issuecomment-3448746806","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112037","id":3448746806,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Nj7M2","user":{"login":"RebelliousX","id":1888186,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4ODgxODY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1888186?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RebelliousX","html_url":"https://github.com/RebelliousX","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RebelliousX/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RebelliousX/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RebelliousX/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RebelliousX/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RebelliousX/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RebelliousX/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RebelliousX/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RebelliousX/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RebelliousX/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-26T18:17:23Z","updated_at":"2025-10-26T18:17:23Z","body":"@clayjohn You are clearly going out of your way just to mention some nonsense without proof.\n\nFirst, look at the images I posted. You said they look the same. Please get some glasses prescriptions if you think they are the same.\n\nSecond, you said they hurt performance. They don't. Have you ever seen a AAA game when you have 160FPS then turning Anisotropic filtering to x16 make the game drop to 155FPS? No., unless your PC is from 1995.\n\nThird, you said we don't want to add an option that provide nothing other than hurting performance. Complete nonsense.\n\nFour, exposing the setting does not mean setting it as default. Nor does it mean encouraging users to use it. You can leave the setting as Linear for default. \n\nFifth, since it is possible to adjust the setting from script per @kleonc two line of code, which works (thank you). That means the viewport texture filter settings in the editor does not show all range of options possible in the script. Don't you think it is an issue here? \n\nFinally, look at the images again that I posted. Click on them to expand them and see the difference.\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3448746806/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":1,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3451691889","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112037#issuecomment-3451691889","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112037","id":3451691889,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7NvKNx","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-27T14:52:32Z","updated_at":"2025-10-27T14:52:32Z","body":"You may be interested in https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/7411, which can make scaled 2D assets look sharper. (This is already available in the engine, but it also affects 3D rendering, while the proposal would allow configuring it separately for 2D and 3D.)","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3451691889/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3452881703","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112037#issuecomment-3452881703","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112037","id":3452881703,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Nzssn","user":{"login":"RebelliousX","id":1888186,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4ODgxODY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1888186?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RebelliousX","html_url":"https://github.com/RebelliousX","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RebelliousX/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RebelliousX/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RebelliousX/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RebelliousX/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RebelliousX/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RebelliousX/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RebelliousX/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RebelliousX/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RebelliousX/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-27T19:09:01Z","updated_at":"2025-10-27T19:09:56Z","body":"@Calinou you mean this #112051 since it is newer. The one you mentioned is already 3 years old, if it was to be taken seriously, it would have been implemented already.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3452881703/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3452924611","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112037#issuecomment-3452924611","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112037","id":3452924611,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Nz3LD","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-27T19:20:49Z","updated_at":"2025-10-27T19:33:26Z","body":"> [@Calinou](https://github.com/Calinou) you mean this [#112051](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112051) since it is newer. The one you mentioned is already 3 years old, if it was to be taken seriously, it would have been implemented already.\n\nNo, I meant to refer to the proposal I linked. It aims to address a *similar* issue you're encountering with no additional performance cost compared to the status quo. That said, it wouldn't address the limitation you're encountering here (but in this case, it's best to change the texture filter on the node that use anamorphic stretching only).\n\nForcing anisotropic filtering might not appear to have a performance impact in your particular setup, but it *will* negatively impact performance on mobile GPUs, integrated graphics or anything that has a shared memory configuration. It may be less obvious in simpler 2D projects, but complex 2D projects with lots of overdraw will definitely run into a performance degradation that brings no visual benefit if textures are only being stretched uniformly. Remember that AF appears to be essentially \"free\" when you don't run into memory bandwidth bottlenecks, but this is rarely the case in complex projects, especially on lower-end devices.\n\nAs an aside, proposals often take a long time to be implemented, especially if they're in a niche area or only matter for advanced use cases. This can also have a positive side, as it makes it more likely that a proposal has been well thought-out and debated among the community before it's implemented ([once something is added, we generally can't take it back](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/about/release_policy.html#what-are-the-criteria-for-compatibility-across-engine-versions)). That said, https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/7411 is a proposal I'm personally interested in seeing implemented, but I don't have time to work on it right now.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3452924611/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]